E
"slabs rocks stones"
"The giant slabs of stone are each cut from a single piece of bedrock.  It must

have been a monumental task, even for a race as large as the ents, to move

such massive stones.  Each stone slab much way thousands of pounds.  The rocks

are a grayish color and appeared quite weathered with their edges rounded and

smooth from time.

"
