#10001
"Ent'Moot"
"Lush foliage grows all about you and not a sign of any decay or illness marks

any of it.  In spite of its apparent wild growth, the foliage doesn't appear

as if it would block your passage in the least.  Perhaps its layout was

planned, after all.  To the west stands a large open-faced stone structure

of some sort.  To the east you can clearly see some sort of large circle of

standing stones.

"
