#10002
"Ent'Moot"
"A garden of lush greenery of all sorts fills every corner of the land.  The

plants grow right up to the sheer edge of the island that overlooks the

Windlass below.  With the uneven edge of the island preventing travel west and

north of here, your only options are to head east or south if you wish to

leave.

"
"will eventually have a quest for ents to get the robe.

