#10003
"Heart of Ent'Moot"
"Several standing stones, some capped and some not, encircle the heart of the

island.  In the center of the stones, at the very heart of the island, is a

stone fountain carved over with ancient runes.  The space between the central

fountain and the standing stones is filled with some of the lushest grass you

have ever seen.  The grass is even, thick, and healthy beyond any doubt.

"
