"Ent'Moot"
"A variety of plants dot the landscape around a single, large oak tree set well

away from the islands edge.  The plants and vegetation grow right up to the

island's sheer edges overlooking the Windlass far below.  The sheer edges

prevent passage west or south so you are limited to heading only north or east

if you want to leave.

