"The island of Ent'Moot is roughly circular in shape.  Sheer walls and loose

stone ensure that the cliff face of the island remains unassailable from any

who would attack unless they could somehow fly up the very sides.  Far below,

you can see the rushing waters of the Windlass as it flows southward away from

the island.  Its swift passage carries it southward as it travels on its way

through the Vaasa and off towards Sos'Kul, land of the lizardfolk.

"
