"Ent'Moot"
"Dense foliage and creeping vines form a arched tunnel through which you can

only catch periodic glimpses of the sky.  The tunnel is too perfectly formed

to be natural and in places where the foliage is slightly less dense you can

make out bits of trellis underneath.  A large root arcs out from here crossing

the river separating the island of Ent'Moot from the mainland of the Vaasa.

